--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The fruit-face texture pool used to render the synthetic training set is built
from three public datasets, in a fixed ratio recorded in the project's texture
policy of 2026-06-23 (1,600 textures per class across apple / orange / banana /
pineapple):

    65%  Fruits-360 (Kaggle)          CC BY-SA 4.0 — attribution + share-alike
    25%  colour-filtered "original" crops   see note below
    10%  FruitSeg30 (Mendeley Data, vkht8pfsp3)

Web-scraped images were deliberately EXCLUDED from the production pack: an
earlier experimental "web orange" pool was found to contaminate the orange class
and over-correct apple/orange confusion, and was archived rather than mixed in.
Visual variation is obtained at render time instead (strong texture
augmentation, mixed layout, 0.35 collage probability). The two Bing-scraping
helper scripts that remain in the history were experiments and feed nothing in
the final pipeline.

> Open item: the exact upstream of the 25% "original colour-filtered" portion
> should be confirmed and attributed before the texture pack itself is
> redistributed. Until then this repository publishes the generation and
> filtering scripts, and perception/docs/synthetic-data.md describes how to
> rebuild the pack from the upstream datasets.

COCO 2017 background images (used as render backgrounds) are not redistributed;
a download script is provided. COCO images are subject to the terms at
https://cocodataset.org/#termsofuse .

